<title>UK: Racal says wins 20 mln stg UK Customs order.</title>
<headline>Racal says wins 20 mln stg UK Customs order.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Racal Electronics Plc said on Monday that its Network Services division has won orders for telephone network and data encryption services for Britain's Customs and Excise, in a deal worth 20 million stg.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 1717 542 7717</p>
</text>
